Package: daybreak
Title: Statistics You Can Read
Version: 0.10.0
Authors@R: person("Abhik", "Roy", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: A local Shiny application that runs fifty-three statistical
    methods and describes each result twice, once for a reader who knows what a
    confidence interval is and once for a reader who does not. Both readings are
    generated by deterministic R code. No language model writes or alters a
    value. Every result can be downloaded as a report, a figure, a table, or an
    R script that reproduces it without this application.
License: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/drabhikroy/daybreak
BugReports: https://github.com/drabhikroy/daybreak/issues
